@startuml learning
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Burn-owned episodic policy objective
component "Validated candidate FeatureBatch\n2271 F64 coordinates; 1..512 rows" as FEATURES <<app>>
component "0..64 sampled decisions\nselected index + frozen baseline + return" as EPISODE <<app>>
component "PolicyModel\nBurn Linear -> ReLU -> Linear\n2271 -> 32 -> 1" as MODEL <<app>>
component "Burn log_softmax + tensor objective" as LOSS <<app>>
component "Burn autodiff + SGD\nsynthetic regression tests" as UPDATE <<app>>
FEATURES --> EPISODE
FEATURES --> MODEL
EPISODE --> LOSS
MODEL --> LOSS
LOSS --> UPDATE
note bottom of LOSS
  A = return - frozen_baseline
  J = -A * sum(log p(selected)) + L2/2 * ||weights||^2
  Empty episodes produce no objective or regularization step.
  No handwritten derivatives or game-data training run.
end note
@enduml
